mgur.com/sKvQO1d.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/0bzO6jP.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IyD3iA5.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/JmLbhkJ.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/UWFTH8U.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xihe1Iq.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mttOKJb.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1S9UjyX.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8U6EqW7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/EY1Banv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pRShE0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ajOKaqG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xyN0hmi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Merge Enchantments 是一款<strong>服务端</strong>&nbsp;模组，你可以在此混合或排除附魔，甚至将它们全部合并。一些例子包括：锋利、亡灵杀手和节肢杀手，所有类型的保护（火焰、爆炸和弹射物），精准采集与时运，激流与引雷/忠诚，密度，穿透，亡灵杀手和节肢杀手。请查看<a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Merge-Enchantments/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>以了解配置的工作原理，你可以在其中设置<a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Merge-Enchantments/wiki/Config#blacklist\" rel=\"nofollow\">黑名单</a>并<a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Merge-Enchantments/wiki/Config#blacklist\" rel=\"nofollow\">合并所有附魔</a>。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/H9nhuOr.gif\" width=\"414\" height=\"233\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/l717aDK.gif\" width=\"414\" height=\"234\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>常见问题解答</strong></span></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Q: 它能与其他模组的附魔兼容吗？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">A: 从 v3.0 版本开始，可以合并所有原版及第三方模组的附魔。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Q: 如何同时获得<span style=\"color:#008000\">精准采集</span>和<span style=\"color:#9c0\">时运</span>？</strong><br>A: 你需要安装 Merge Enchantments 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toggle-enchantments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Toggle Enchantments<br></a><strong>Q: 如何让<span style=\"color:#36f\">激流</span>与<span style=\"color:#f60\">忠诚</span>和<span style=\"color:#fc0\">引雷</span>共存？</strong><br>A: 你需要安装 Merge Enchantments 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/improved-trident-enchantments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Improved Trident Enchantments</a></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Q: 这是客户端还是服务端模组？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">A: 从 v4.2 版本开始，本模组仅支持服务端。<br><strong>Q: 我可以将 Merge Enchantments 包含在我的整合包中吗？</strong><br>A: 当然可以，只需在相关项目中添加我的模组即可。</span></li>\n</ul>",
